{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l041", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 41, "raw": "Белгилүү барбай,", "text": "Белгилүү барбай,", "en": "The renowned one did not go,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Very short and faint baseline.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l042", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 42, "raw": "Тапты, майрайтуу болдуңуз,", "text": "Тапты, майрайтуу болдуңуз,", "en": "You found it and began lamenting,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Middle word is especially uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l043", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 43, "raw": "Шундай бардың жерге дей,", "text": "Шундай бардың жерге дей,", "en": "Thus you went to that place, he said,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Initial demonstrative preserves an uncertain spelling.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l044", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 44, "raw": "Ичи сыздайт, жоор белим,", "text": "Ичи сыздайт, жоор белим,", "en": "My insides ache, my sore back,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final noun may be another body-part term.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l045", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 45, "raw": "Саналып кетип тер издеп,", "text": "Саналып кетип тер издеп,", "en": "Counting them, he went searching for a trace,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "First word and object are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l046", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 46, "raw": "Олжого барат төрт жүз миң,", "text": "Олжого барат төрт жүз миң,", "en": "Four hundred thousand go for the booty,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Numeral phrase is difficult and may be segmented differently.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l047", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 47, "raw": "Курусун сонун эр өлсөң,", "text": "Курусун сонун эр өлсөң,", "en": "Alas, if a fine hero should die,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Several letters overlap between words.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l048", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 48, "raw": "Калтырып барып төрт миң,", "text": "Калтырып барып төрт миң,", "en": "Leaving them behind, four thousand went,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Numeral and preceding verb are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l049", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 49, "raw": "Калың элди чаап кетип,", "text": "Калың элди чаап кетип,", "en": "He raided the multitude and departed,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The object may be “журтту” rather than “элди.”", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l050", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 50, "raw": "Соңунан кошуп тер менен,", "text": "Соңунан кошуп тер менен,", "en": "Following afterward with the gathered host,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final noun is unclear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l051", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 51, "raw": "Он ондоп барды эл менен,", "text": "Он ондоп барды эл менен,", "en": "They went by tens with the people,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Numeral expression is difficult to read.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l052", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 52, "raw": "Курчап барып төрт миң,", "text": "Курчап барып төрт миң,", "en": "Four thousand went and surrounded them,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Numeral may be “жүз миң.”", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l053", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 53, "raw": "Кайрадан согуш салды эми,", "text": "Кайрадан согуш салды эми,", "en": "Now he began battle again,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Final word is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l054", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 54, "raw": "Белгилүү болуп эр өлмөк,", "text": "Белгилүү болуп эр өлмөк,", "en": "A renowned hero was to die,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Verb form is difficult to distinguish.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l055", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 55, "raw": "Калкын сууга чөктүрүп,", "text": "Калкын сууга чөктүрүп,", "en": "Drowning his people in the water,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Object and causative verb are uncertain.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l056", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 56, "raw": "Калмактарды баштап келип,", "text": "Калмактарды баштап келип,", "en": "Leading the Kalmyks here,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Ethnonym is the likeliest reading but not fully clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l057", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 57, "raw": "Талашып моюндабай,", "text": "Талашып моюндабай,", "en": "Arguing, he would not acknowledge it,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "First word may be a personal name.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l058", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 58, "raw": "Тай тайраңдап болду эми,", "text": "Тай тайраңдап болду эми,", "en": "The colt now pranced about,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Repeated initial word and verb are faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current142:pdf026:l059", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current142", "pdf_sha256": "2b1fd33d35b9fec662724180743e44a26bc44d8b347d5f99c373acf98cb6c73f", "page": 26, "folio": 2343, "line_in_page": 59, "raw": "Шундай баарыңыз жоор экен,", "text": "Шундай баарыңыз жоор экен,", "en": "Thus all of you were wounded,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Pronoun and adjective may be read differently.", "bbox": null}
